  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5026.02 Accident Report.\n\nA written accident report shall be sent by the operator who conducted the firework display to the commissioner within 48 hours of any accident resulting in injury, death, or damage to property on the form described in Saf-C 5029.04.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5000) #6055, eff 7-1-95; amd by #7481, eff 4-25-01; paragraphs (b)(1)-(6) and (8)-(14) EXPIRED: 7-1-03; amd by #8117, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04; paragraphs (b)(1)-(6) and (8)-(14) EXPIRED: 1-10-05; amd by #8261, eff 1-21-05; amd by #9471, INTERIM, eff 5-15-09, EXPIRED: 11-11-09\n\nNew. #9765-A, eff 8-2-10; ss by #12124, eff 3-6-17",
